rs", "probability": 0.017983221572254227}], "representatives": ["space_01", "space_08", "space_04"], "prevalence": 0.25512186725533526, "dominant_count": 8}], "documents": [{"id": "space_01", "category": "Space exploration", "text": "The spacecraft entered orbit around the planet. The mission collected images from a satellite and sent space observations to Earth.", "tokens": ["spacecraft", "entered", "orbit", "around", "planet", "mission", "collected", "images", "satellite", "sent", "space", "observations", "earth"], "theta": [0.011194029850746263, 0.0074626865671641755, 0.0074626865671641755, 0.9738805970149255], "dominant": 3}, {"id": "space_02", "category": "Space exploration", "text": "Astronauts aboard the space station repaired a satellite. Their mission studied how orbit affects equipment and human movement.", "tokens": ["astronauts", "aboard", "space", "station", "repaired", "satellite", "mission", "studied", "how", "orbit", "affects", "equipment", "human", "movement"], "theta": [0.027777777777777755, 0.013888888888888892, 0.010416666666666668, 0.9479166666666666], "dominant": 3}, {"id": "space_03", "category": "Space exploration", "text": "A rocket launched the spacecraft toward the moon. Mission engineers adjusted the orbit and monitored the space journey.", "tokens": ["rocket", "launched", "spacecraft", "toward", "moon", "mission", "engineers", "adjusted", "orbit", "monitored", "space", "journey"], "theta": [0.016129032258064512, 0.012096774193548383, 0.06451612903225806, 0.907258064516129], "dominant": 3}, {"id": "space_04", "category": "Space exploration", "text": "The telescope observed a distant planet and its moon. Space researchers used satellite images to study the orbit of the planet.", "tokens": ["telescope", "observed", "distant", "planet", "moon", "space", "researchers", "used", "satellite", "images", "study", "orbit", "planet"], "theta": [0.014925373134328354, 0.0074626865671641755, 0.026119402985074626, 0.9514925373134325], "dominant": 3}, {"id": "space_05", "category": "Space exploration", "text": "Engineers tested a rocket engine for the next space mission. The spacecraft will carry a satellite into orbit around Earth.", "tokens": ["engineers", "tested", "rocket", "engine", "next", "space", "mission", "spacecraft", "carry", "satellite", "orbit", "around", "earth"], "theta": [0.03358208955223883, 0.04850746268656718, 0.02238805970149254, 0.8955223880597012], "dominant": 3}, {"id": "space_06", "category": "Space exploration", "text": "The moon mission landed a spacecraft near a crater. Astronauts collected rock samples while a satellite measured the lunar surface.", "tokens": ["moon", "mission", "landed", "spacecraft", "near", "crater", "astronauts", "collected", "rock", "samples", "while", "satellite", "measured", "lunar", "surface"], "theta": [0.012987012987012988, 0.019480519480519484, 0.016233766233766236, 0.9512987012987015], "dominant": 3}, {"id": "space_07", "category": "Space exploration", "text": "A satellite tracked weather patterns from orbit. The space mission used telescope observations to compare Earth and another planet.", "tokens": ["satellite", "tracked", "weather", "patterns", "orbit", "space", "mission", "used", "telescope", "observations", "compare", "earth", "another", "planet"], "theta": [0.01041666666666667, 0.006944444444444446, 0.15625000000000003, 0.826388888888889], "dominant": 3}, {"id": "space_08", "category": "Space exploration", "text": "The spacecraft changed orbit to inspect a planet. A rocket booster supported the mission while astronauts prepared space experiments.", "tokens": ["spacecraft", "changed", "orbit", "inspect", "planet", "rocket", "booster", "supported", "mission", "while", "astronauts", "prepared", "space", "experiments"], "theta": [0.017361111111111112, 0.013888888888888886, 0.010416666666666668, 0.9583333333333333], "dominant": 3}, {"id": "sport_01", "category": "Sport and cricket", "text": "The cricket team won the match after the captain scored runs. Pl